From: MOM Harness <mom-harness@example.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] lua: expose opt-in real Luau harness authority

Target: OursCodeur/openmw clockwork-alpha, c5e5a9a6362c35512823884753d2d5284af204fa.
Keep the ordinary sandbox unchanged. The harness explicitly opts into
real collector control and atomic result writing. No LuaJIT or
filesystem libraries are emulated.

