+.. omw-setting::
+   :title: unsafe stdlib access
+   :type: boolean
+   :range: true, false
+   :default: false
+
+   Exposes real Luau garbage-collector control through
+   ``select("sandbox.bypass").collectgarbage`` for harness tests.
+   Supports ``collect``, ``count``, ``stop``, ``restart``, ``step``, and
+   ``isrunning``. Also exposes ``writeAtomic(path, bytes)`` to publish test
+   results through an actual temporary-file write and rename. Does not expose
+   filesystem libraries or LuaJIT libraries.
+
 .. omw-setting::
    :title: memory limit
    :type: int
